# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Edge Functions environment (Supabase server-side)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These are NOT read from this file when deployed. When you deploy Edge
# Functions to Supabase, SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are
# automatically injected. You only need to set ADDITIONAL secrets in the
# Dashboard: Project Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets (e.g. RESEND_API_KEY).
#
# For LOCAL development (supabase functions serve), you can set:
# - SUPABASE_URL and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY here (copy to .env, do not commit)
# - Or run: supabase secrets set SUPABASE_URL=... SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=...
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
